[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3219273027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109900#issuecomment-3219273027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109900","id":3219273027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_4jVD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-25T08:13:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-25T08:13:40Z","body":"Is there any known issues this solves? Please explain why this is needed, this incurs an overhead so it's not free, so needs to be justified ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3219273027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3222115977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109900#issuecomment-3222115977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109900","id":3222115977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ADZaJ","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T00:13:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T00:13:40Z","body":"> Is there any known issues this solves? Please explain why this is needed, this incurs an overhead so it's not free, so needs to be justified\r\n\r\nIf you create nodes from multiple threads (e.g., in my game I instantiate scenes on a background thread to avoid freezes and stutters on the main thread), the orphan node count becomes incorrect over time due to race conditions and differs from the actual `print_orphan_nodes()` output.\r\n\r\nEven though I didn't see any overhead in my profiler, I improved it so that the overhead is only when creating/destroying nodes, instead of when they are added/removed from the `SceneTree`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3222115977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3284880335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109900#issuecomment-3284880335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109900","id":3284880335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Dy0vP","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-12T11:21:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-12T11:21:41Z","body":"I just thought of a secret third option: It would be possible to remove `orphan_node_count`, and instead infer it from `ObjectDB` when orphan node counts should be counted.\r\nI don't know how slow that would be compared to the current implementation, but it would have the major advantage of not needing the slow atomics (or risking data mangling) to keep track of the counts.\r\n\r\nI'll schedule to discuss this at an upcoming core meeting.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3284880335/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329732007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109900#issuecomment-3329732007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109900","id":3329732007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gd62n","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T16:15:14Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T16:15:46Z","body":"We just discussed this in the Core meeting, and agreed to go ahead with this PR.\r\n\r\nHowever, there was one concern raised, which is the additional construction and destruction cost of atomics that would be added to `Node`. To mitigate this, please wrap the `orphan_node_count` (the variable, as well as the related logic) with `#ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED`. The `Performance::_get_orphan_node_count` function should simply return 0 on non-debug builds.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329732007/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3354130490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109900#issuecomment-3354130490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109900","id":3354130490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H6_g6","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T23:39:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T23:39:16Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3354130490/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]